     - ini round trip: TOPPBase writes version into ini; loading a 1.x-era ini (which carries the OpenMS version string, e.g. "3.6.0-pre-...") will now trigger TOPPBase's version-mismatch warning. Harmless, arguably desired for a breaking release.
     - mzML software entry now says SpeXtractor 2.0.0 instead of OpenMS x.y — downstream consumers that keyed on "OpenMS" name won't match; but name was already "SpeXtractor". Fine.
