     - One more: the fallback `#define SPEXTRACTOR_VERSION "2.0.0"` in src (line 62-63) means a build outside CMake (or a stale CMake) silently hardcodes 2.0.0 — version drift risk on future releases (two sources of truth: CMakeLists PROJECT_VERSION and the hardcoded fallback). Minor release-engineering nit. LOW.
